OL,3,AVance pressed on whether Iran war will
OL,4,Abe resolved before US midterm elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FVice-President JD Vance faced questions
OL,7,Ffrom journalists at the first White
OL,8,FHouse press briefing in weeks - here's
OL,9,Fa recap of what we heard
OL,11,FAsked if the Iran war will be resolved
OL,12,Fbefore the US midterm elections in
OL,13,FNovember, Vance says he "wouldn't call
OL,14,Fit a war", adding that there's "no
OL,15,Factive shooting right now"
OL,17,FVance adds, "You would have to ask the
OL,18,FIranians" when they will stop shooting
OL,19,Fat commercial ships
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
