OL,3,AVance pressed on whether Iran war will
OL,4,Abe resolved before US midterm elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FPushed on the economy, he says the
OL,7,Freason gas prices are so high in the US
OL,8,Fis because "Iranians are shooting at
OL,9,Fcommercial shipping" in the Strait of
OL,10,FHormuz
OL,12,FVance is also asked about reports of a
OL,13,FUS missile strike killing four people
OL,14,Fat a wedding celebration in Iran - the
OL,15,Fvice-president says officials are
OL,16,Finvestigating. BBC Verify has looked
OL,17,Finto it
